FR:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Je sais que tu m'aimes bien,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} mais tu
voudrais pas chercher les autres
aussi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hey, hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}you already found me just
a little while ago!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hurry up and look for the others.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Otherwise you'll run out of time!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Pero si a mí ya me has encontrado.
¡Menuda memoria tienes! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Date prisa y encuentra a los demás{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
antes de que se te acabe el tiempo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Calma, calma! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Mi avevi già trovato,
ricordi? Poco tempo fa!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Sbrigati e cerca gli altri giocatori,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
prima che scada il tempo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Was willst du schon wieder hier?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Du hast mich doch vorhin schon
gefunden!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Jag lieber die anderen aus ihren
Verstecken, bevor dir noch die Zeit
ausgeht!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}You know,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}if you just wander about
like this and waste your time,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}you
won't be able to find everyone!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Un consejo:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}No pierdas el tiempo
hablando conmigo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡o no darás
con los demás!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Il y a un petit malentendu...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu dois
trouver tout le monde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}pas juste
moi !{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Un consiglio da amico:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}se continui
a girare a vuoto in questo modo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
non troverai mai gli altri giocatori!{{TAG:0007:0008:3C000000}}

